# claude-box — private scope→registry mappings (OPTIONAL)
#
# Copy this file to `registries.npmrc` (gitignored) and add one line per private
# scope you use. At `./claude-box build` these lines are appended to the image's
# user-level ~/.npmrc, so pnpm/npm resolve those scopes to the private registry.
#
# The matching auth token line
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_REGISTRY_ACCESS_TOKEN}
# is already baked into the image and resolved at runtime from the env var the
# runner forwards, so you only need the scope mapping(s) here.
#
# Example — route an org scope to GitHub Packages:
#@my-org:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com/
